   "text": "Helicopter Data and Voice Recorder Requirement Act\n This bill makes it unlawful for an air carrier to operate a single or multiengine, turbine-powered helicopter with one or more passenger seats and one or more pilots without a flight data recorder and cockpit voice recorder."
